alse\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi_{max}(d) = \\phi_0 \\cdot h(d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是基础偏折角，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h(d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是随距离衰减的窗口——距离越远，屏幕上目标越小、容许的偏折角越小，避免远距离「隔着半个屏幕也能吸中」的荒谬。Halopedia 明确指出，不同武器的子弹磁吸强度差异很大：近战爆发武器给得慷慨，精确步枪则收得很紧，以免完全免除长枪的瞄准价值。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[扣下扳机] --&gt; B[取准星射线 a 与目标方向 t]&#10;    B --&gt; C[计算夹角 theta]&#10;    C --&gt; D{theta 小于等于 phi_max?}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E[弹道拧到 t 上&lt;br/&gt;红准星亮 必中]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| F[弹道拧过 phi_max&lt;br/&gt;仍偏 但偏得少]&#10;    E --&gt; G[命中判定]&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H{命中体含容差?}&#10;    H --&gt;|擦边| I[命中容差补上&lt;br/&gt;擦边算命中]&#10;    H --&gt;|正中| J[直接命中]\">flowchart TD\n    A[扣下扳机] --&gt; B[取准星射线 a 与目标方向 t]\n    B --&gt; C[计算夹角 theta]\n    C --&gt; D{theta 小于等于 phi_max?}\n    D --&gt;|是| E[弹道拧到 t 上&lt;br/&gt;红准星亮 必中]\n    D --&gt;|否| F[弹道拧过 phi_max&lt;br/&gt;仍偏 但偏得少]\n    E --&gt; G[命中判定]\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H{命中体含容差?}\n    H --&gt;|擦边| I[命中容差补上&lt;br/&gt;擦边算命中]\n    H --&gt;|正中| J[直接命中]</pre><h2 id=\"为什么它是最慷慨也最微妙的一层\">为什么它是最慷慨也最微妙的一层</h2><p>子弹修正的慷慨在于：它是唯一能把「差一点」直接变成「命中」的机制。减速区和磁吸只是让玩家更容易把准星压上去，压不上去就是打不中；子弹磁吸却在压不上去时仍能救回一发。对手感的贡献巨大——命中的爽感直接拉满，尤其对新手，这是让他们留下的关键正反馈，也正是 <a href=\"../foundations/why-aim-assist\">为何瞄准辅助</a> 里「留存」动机最直接的技术兑现。</p>\n<p>微妙之处也恰在于此。因为它发生在开火后、脱离玩家控制，玩家会产生两种截然相反的归因：一种是惊喜（「这枪居然中了」），一种是空虚（「这不算我打的」）。这正是 <a href=\"../foundations/perceptibility\">可察觉性与手感</a> 讨论的双向陷阱在第三层的具体化——红准星把「你被修正了」明明白白画出来，慷慨但露馅；隐形的命中容差不给任何提示，隐形但一旦被数据挖出会引发「暗改判定」的信任危机。设计者要在「让玩家知道自己被帮了」与「让玩家以为全靠自己」之间选边站，而 Halo 选择了前者——红准星是一种诚实的设计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与网络判定的纠缠\">与网络判定的纠缠</h2><p>子弹修正在多人游戏里还多一层麻烦：它必须和延迟补偿协同。子弹到底该拧向目标的「哪个位置」——玩家屏幕上看到的敌人（已经过插值、落后于真实位置），还是服务器权威的当前位置？如果偏折在客户端算、按客户端看到的位置修正，再交给服务器用 <a href=\"../../game-development/multiplayer-netcode/techniques/lag-compensation\">延迟补偿</a> 回滚验证，就可能出现「客户端判定被磁吸拧中、服务器回滚后并未命中」的不一致。多数权威架构的做法是：磁吸只影响客户端提交的射线方向，最终命中与否仍由服务器按回滚后的历史位置裁定。也就是说，子弹修正修的是「你朝哪开」，而不是「判没判中」——后者的最终裁量权始终在权威端。这条边界与目标获取里遮挡查询依赖战斗系统命中体是同一类分工：辅助只管指向，判定归判定系统。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>子弹修正是三层辅助里唯一开火后生效、玩家无法干预的一层，含子弹磁吸（修方向）、命中容差（修判定）、红准星（画提示）三种常叠加的形态。</li>\n<li>核心参数是最大偏折角 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta \\le \\phi_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时弹道被完全拧到目标（红准星必中），否则只拧 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 随武器与距离收窄。</li>\n<li>它是最慷慨的补偿（能把「差一点」变成命中），也最微妙——露馅（红准星）与暗改（隐形容差）各有信任代价。</li>\n<li>多人环境下磁吸只影响客户端提交的射线方向，命中与否仍由服务器按延迟补偿回滚裁定；辅助指向、判定系统裁定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>开火前的第一二层补偿：<a href=\"magnetism-friction\">磁吸与减速区</a></li>\n<li>子弹该修向谁：<a href=\"target-acquisition\">目标获取</a></li>\n<li>慷慨补偿对应的留存动机：<a href=\"../foundations/why-aim-assist\">为何瞄准辅助</a></li>\n<li>命中/落空的最终裁定：<a href=\"../../game-development/multiplayer-netcode/techniques/lag-compensation\">多人联机 · 延迟补偿</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"子弹修正","id":"子弹修正"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"三种开火后补偿形态","id":"三种开火后补偿形态"},{"level":2,"text":"偏折角的数学与上限","id":"偏折角的数学与上限"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么它是最慷慨也最微妙的一层","id":"为什么它是最慷慨也最微妙的一层"},{"level":2,"text":"与网络判定的纠缠","id":"与网络判定的纠缠"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"目标获取","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-aim-assist-systems/techniques/target-acquisition"},"next":{"title":"输入公平 (手柄vs鼠标)","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-aim-assist-systems/balance/input-fairness"}}